Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.27,0:00:03.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（心园先生）来吧，乐园区域中
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.99,0:00:06.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}存活下来的14名决斗者，现在
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.27,0:00:07.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}即将冲入
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.22,0:00:08.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下一场战斗的舞台！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.30,0:00:12.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从被蓝天与阳光笼罩的竞技场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.82,0:00:15.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}前往没有光明的黑暗地下区域！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.90,0:00:27.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）存活下来的过山车有14台。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.52,0:00:29.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凯西）游马也在其中喵。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.53,0:00:33.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去吧！一飞冲天啊，游马！！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.44,0:00:36.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德之助）啊啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.75,0:00:38.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是游马是第14名。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.72,0:00:39.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德之助）最后一名啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.47,0:00:41.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种事没关系喵！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.32,0:00:43.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这又不是赛跑。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.77,0:00:46.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）说得对。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.07,0:00:47.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}胜负终究要看决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.99,0:00:50.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是啊，那么黑的话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.05,0:00:52.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么都看不见嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.77,0:00:55.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，背后到底会发生什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.47,0:00:57.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算在背后搞什么名堂，也看不出来嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.20,0:01:01.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管有什么陷阱在等着都要猫步前进哦，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.04,0:01:03.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（Mr.心园）那么，接下来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.82,0:01:05.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就为大家介绍地下区域的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.16,0:01:05.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}精彩看点吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.19,0:01:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里的目的，直截了当地说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.90,0:01:10.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是决定一对一决斗的对手。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.67,0:01:12.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个舞台就是……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.75,0:01:16.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}岩浆
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.02,0:01:17.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太空
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.49,0:01:19.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}丛林
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.85,0:01:20.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}峡谷。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.34,0:01:23.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拥有四种特性的场地。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.43,0:01:25.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，把对手引诱到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.47,0:01:28.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对自己有利的场地上，然后进行决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.07,0:01:33.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}燃烧吧，心之燃烧！！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.39,0:01:41.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从这里开始才是真正的地狱。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.24,0:01:44.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁能活下来……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.72,0:03:18.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）听到了吗？游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.43,0:03:19.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心园先生的话。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.22,0:03:22.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）啊啊 地下区域的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.40,0:03:25.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是决定一对一的对手啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.04,0:03:27.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）游马你打算跟谁打？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.81,0:03:30.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁都行啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.18,0:03:33.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}放马过来吧…一飞冲天！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.37,0:03:35.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 场地只有4个。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.61,0:03:38.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 能进行决斗的只有8个人。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.37,0:03:39.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.87,0:03:42.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一对一不是2个人打吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.94,0:03:44.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}4个场地的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.51,0:03:47.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}2乘4等于8个人。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.11,0:03:50.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错！8个人。8。哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.51,0:03:53.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎～！？才8个人？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.17,0:03:56.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话说…你现在才注意到？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.67,0:03:58.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因…因为啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.17,0:04:02.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 这么黑漆漆的要怎么找对手啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.31,0:04:02.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.81,0:04:04.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}显示器上有地图。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.02,0:04:08.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，这样一来谁在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.44,0:04:10.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能知道了是吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.96,0:04:12.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（V）最前面的我是1号。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.06,0:04:13.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆是2号。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.86,0:04:17.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着3号就是快斗了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.64,0:04:19.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）托隆……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.39,0:04:21.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能让你逃掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.71,0:04:23.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）好像很有趣！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.33,0:04:26.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这片黑暗之中到底藏着什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.16,0:04:30.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真让人兴奋！啊哈哈哈哈哈哈！！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.89,0:04:34.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德罗瓦）托隆要和你战斗的，是我。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.56,0:04:36.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等着吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.69,0:04:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把我的生命值提升到极限，然后把你……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.43,0:04:45.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凌牙）IV！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.48,0:04:46.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我马上就追上去。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.16,0:04:52.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这个区域里……我一定要打倒你。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.19,0:04:54.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（IV）没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.82,0:04:58.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（IV）好啊。跟上来吧，凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.34,0:05:00.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就这样把你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.26,0:05:02.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}引诱到岩浆场去。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.01,0:05:05.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《凌牙……你的卡组是水属性。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.33,0:05:10.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在灼热的岩浆场里你毫无胜算》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.83,0:05:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《戈什：那时候
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.96,0:05:16.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}掳走哈鲁特的，就是那家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.31,0:05:20.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在前夜祭上看到那家伙的时候，我就有直觉了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.70,0:05:23.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙的长相，和那时候游马
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.64,0:05:25.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说的一模一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.25,0:05:27.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}据德罗瓦所说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.65,0:05:29.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}掳走哈鲁特的那帮人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.36,0:05:32.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在背后操纵的，就是那个特隆。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.50,0:05:34.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}V……特隆。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.77,0:05:36.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他们之间是什么关系
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.92,0:05:38.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又为什么盯上哈鲁特我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.85,0:05:43.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但敢往我脸上抹黑你得给我付出代价！》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.58,0:05:45.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}碍事！碍事！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.79,0:05:48.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.77,0:05:51.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别在本大爷面前乱跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.82,0:05:54.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗终于开始了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.99,0:05:56.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}13号的燃烧虎丸
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.20,0:06:00.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正在向12号的戈修发起挑战！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.48,0:06:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看我把你踢飞。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.80,0:06:07.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，墙壁创造者！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.25,0:06:11.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吵死了，现在可不是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.30,0:06:13.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对付你这种杂鱼的时候。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.23,0:06:17.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡，英雄呼唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.90,0:06:20.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.66,0:06:23.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤英雄挑战者。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.83,0:06:26.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，战锤！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.18,0:06:33.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被踢飞的，是你才对。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.58,0:06:37.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，战锤！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.16,0:06:48.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就转眼间结束了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.79,0:06:52.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不愧是原WDC运营委员，戈修。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.51,0:06:56.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}长得帅，技术也是一流。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.52,0:06:59.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快，把镜头切到游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.82,0:07:02.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到处都在开打了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.98,0:07:06.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶，我也得赶紧去战斗才行。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.14,0:07:08.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}稍微刹一脚！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.37,0:07:10.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}前面有陷阱点。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.70,0:07:11.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.31,0:07:11.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你看。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.95,0:07:20.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骗人的吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.15,0:07:23.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的，谁让你不好好看路。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.48,0:07:29.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了来了，气氛不错嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.22,0:07:31.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来场V对决吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.26,0:07:33.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又是戈修。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.79,0:07:36.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次他向V发起了挑战。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.25,0:07:39.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在就让我们见识一场热血沸腾的战斗吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.81,0:07:42.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心在燃烧！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.24,0:07:45.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼，你要和我打吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.17,0:07:49.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战锤，直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.68,0:07:56.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌发动魔法卡发动奈落的闪光。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.49,0:08:00.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以无效怪兽的攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.29,0:08:02.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并将那只怪兽返回手牌。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.42,0:08:06.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧，真没劲啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.32,0:08:10.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别用这种耍小聪明的打法{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给我全力上啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.39,0:08:13.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对你没必要用全力。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.70,0:08:17.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡 处罚的火焰。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.20,0:08:19.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}造成600点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.34,0:08:30.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎呀 戈什燃烧起来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.93,0:08:33.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这 这个对好孩子们来说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.24,0:08:35.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是不是有点太刺激了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.65,0:08:38.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿嘿。 哦… 哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.19,0:08:40.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别的地方也有战斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.24,0:08:43.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是亚洲冠军IV！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.25,0:08:45.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 上吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.77,0:08:48.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}杀手骑士 直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.69,0:08:57.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这边5号的凌牙也正要扑过来。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.35,0:09:01.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，大·颚·鲨，大嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.75,0:09:11.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被干掉了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.49,0:09:16.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好样的，凌牙，就这样跟上来。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.26,0:09:19.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由我来带你下地狱。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.35,0:09:22.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（塞）IV好强，好帅！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.85,0:09:24.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（幸）鲨鱼才更强呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.90,0:09:27.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么呀，IV明明强多了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.01,0:09:28.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也帅多了好吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.78,0:09:29.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吵死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.66,0:09:31.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最强最帅的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.71,0:09:33.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当然是游马啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.41,0:09:35.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）才没有。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.61,0:09:36.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小猫……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.51,0:09:40.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行。去那边的话又会……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.89,0:09:49.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}骗人……啊啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.66,0:09:53.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}得……得好好看着才行。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.12,0:09:55.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}观察结果 其19。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.44,0:09:57.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然游马
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.43,0:09:58.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是个笨蛋。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.36,0:10:05.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德罗瓦）前方有魔法点。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.46,0:10:10.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果我的直觉没错 恐怕……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.98,0:10:13.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.46,0:10:17.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}治疗之神 迪安·凯特。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.34,0:10:20.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为这个效果我的生命值提升了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.58,0:10:24.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}7000吗 还不够。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.94,0:10:27.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要和他战斗 还需要更多生命值……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.11,0:10:28.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.67,0:10:34.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又停下来了。 特隆 这个动作是……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.37,0:10:35.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}轨道！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.22,0:10:38.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（轨道7）是 快斗大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.91,0:10:42.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.2特隆的过山车动作很奇怪。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.92,0:10:43.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}立刻去调查。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.06,0:10:44.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遵命！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.33,0:10:46.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特隆……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.64,0:10:55.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又是陷阱卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.52,0:11:03.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（特隆）陷阱卡 胡蝶之毒。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.94,0:11:05.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是对我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.55,0:11:07.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}造成1000点伤害的陷阱。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.83,0:11:14.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵呵…… 到处都到处布下各种陷阱{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.51,0:11:17.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打算把我引到哪儿去呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.27,0:11:21.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}越来越有意思了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.64,0:11:29.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《还远远不够。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.85,0:11:32.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}更多… 把生命值削得更多》
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.19,0:11:35.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生命值居然只剩２００了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.00,0:11:38.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被削成这样你想怎么办啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.42,0:11:40.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你… 你问我怎么办。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.50,0:11:43.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是在决斗里掉的也就算了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.88,0:11:45.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可你偏偏自己踩上陷阱。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.14,0:11:47.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这能怪我吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.71,0:11:49.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 前面！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.81,0:11:50.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.58,0:11:53.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！ 陷… 陷阱点！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.60,0:11:55.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刹车！！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.09,0:12:04.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.55,0:12:05.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又来？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.17,0:12:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡 命运的分岔路。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.70,0:12:11.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这里进行抛硬币{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.73,0:12:13.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果正面朝上　生命值提升２０００。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.43,0:12:16.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果背面朝上　受到２０００伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.32,0:12:18.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是２０００哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.45,0:12:19.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来就来！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.75,0:12:22.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对会出正面　提升２０００！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.11,0:12:23.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等一下！　万一出了背面
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.98,0:12:25.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生命值就归零了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.65,0:12:28.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼！　我减少的生命值我自己来夺回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.94,0:12:30.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.62,0:12:32.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马的话　我就知道你会这么说。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.71,0:12:39.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！　一飞冲天吧　我！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.42,0:12:45.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来多少次都是白费。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.37,0:12:47.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是赢不了我的。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.33,0:12:49.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少罗嗦！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.48,0:12:52.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别给我叽叽歪歪的！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.92,0:12:55.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的气势还没结束呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.04,0:12:56.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}愚蠢。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.07,0:13:01.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧…… 但是这一刻我可是等很久了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.93,0:13:04.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己的生命值降到500以下的时候！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.19,0:13:06.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.05,0:13:08.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤英雄挑战者·双枪！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.42,0:13:17.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽 1只可以当作2只份的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.73,0:13:18.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量素材！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.58,0:13:21.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把 变成2只份的等级4
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.75,0:13:23.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双枪进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.12,0:13:27.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只份的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.59,0:13:29.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.04,0:13:31.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.87,0:13:36.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 英雄冠军·圣剑！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.43,0:13:43.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}圣剑 在我的生命值 不降到500以下
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.11,0:13:44.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就无法攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.12,0:13:46.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在 就是那个时候！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.16,0:13:49.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把 叠放单元 全部使用
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.85,0:13:52.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让圣剑的攻击力变成2倍！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.02,0:13:57.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 圣剑！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.63,0:13:59.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对V直接攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.27,0:14:03.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一刀两断，必杀神剑！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.45,0:14:05.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可笑。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.94,0:14:09.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动陷阱卡，奈落中蠢动之物。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.83,0:14:14.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以无效攻击力2000以上的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.47,0:14:16.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽的攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.13,0:14:18.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，给对手玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.91,0:14:20.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}造成那只怪兽攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.77,0:14:22.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一半的伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.64,0:14:26.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什……什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.16,0:14:31.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然被自己人的刀刃斩裂，真是可怜的家伙……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.41,0:14:37.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.09,0:14:37.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.54,0:14:41.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是阿查查查巴啦，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.77,0:14:43.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！我从手牌中
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.45,0:14:45.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤阿查查查巴啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.96,0:14:52.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿查查查巴啦可以
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.46,0:14:54.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效产生的效果伤害，
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.75,0:14:55.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并给对手玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.72,0:14:57.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予４００点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.06,0:15:03.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不……不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.03,0:15:05.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的生命值……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.07,0:15:13.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呐　Ｖ……要召唤怪兽吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.20,0:15:14.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.92,0:15:17.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他　就先放着别管吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.72,0:15:21.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明白了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.84,0:15:33.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂　游马！　为什么不追？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.33,0:15:37.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也　对Ｖ应该有被骗的怨恨吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.18,0:15:40.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在　比起那种事　先把你的生命值
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.74,0:15:42.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恢复过来再说！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.53,0:15:44.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你……　你……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.46,0:15:45.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来　跟我走！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.92,0:15:47.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂！　去哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.97,0:15:52.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马……　他的目的是胜利吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.66,0:15:54.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还是　友情呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.64,0:15:57.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）真像啊　和一马。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.94,0:16:00.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九一马……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.36,0:16:03.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他也曾珍视友情。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.23,0:16:05.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那或许就是招来不幸的原因吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.62,0:16:08.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，就是这里！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.38,0:16:12.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（戈什）这家伙是……陷阱点？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.98,0:16:16.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你就是用这个回复生命值的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.40,0:16:20.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊，靠掷硬币，漂亮地掷出了正面
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.19,0:16:21.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拿到了２０００。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.73,0:16:24.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（戈什）真是个让人无语的家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.24,0:16:27.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也只能相信自己的运气去干了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.29,0:16:29.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过要是失败了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.44,0:16:31.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就会被扣掉２０００点生命值。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.72,0:16:34.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.51,0:16:36.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给我打起精神来掷硬币啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.97,0:16:38.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再见啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.92,0:16:43.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}切！那混蛋……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.90,0:16:47.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了！我又迟到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.85,0:16:57.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，陷阱点！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.92,0:17:14.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.21,0:17:25.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）攻击力　２９５０
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.28,0:17:27.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}２７００
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.36,0:17:29.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.16,0:17:31.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊哈哈哈！好厉害啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.13,0:17:35.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对我一个人竟然有３只这种超重量级的怪兽…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.13,0:17:37.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是辛苦你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.00,0:17:59.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（多洛瓦）一口气对付３个人…。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.72,0:18:02.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特隆的强大 深不可测。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.34,0:18:05.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.85,0:18:09.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不能让快斗去和特隆战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.16,0:18:13.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}人数缩减下来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.27,0:18:16.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}２３名决赛大会晋级者中
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.59,0:18:19.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在公园区域存活下来的有１４名。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.09,0:18:24.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 在目前的地下区域又有６名被淘汰
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.05,0:18:26.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}剩下８名！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.57,0:18:31.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小猫 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.13,0:18:33.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于 游马出现在画面上了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.26,0:18:36.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我还担心他是不是被淘汰了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.74,0:18:38.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底…太好了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.16,0:18:41.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 其他家伙全都是强敌的说。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.36,0:18:44.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马的话肯定没问题！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.02,0:18:46.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用一飞冲天加油吧～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.88,0:18:49.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 接下来就是一对一决斗了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.81,0:18:51.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}目标决斗场地有４个！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.19,0:18:55.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}选手们啊 去战斗吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.06,0:18:59.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心之燃烧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.33,0:19:07.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 跟上我 凌牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.76,0:19:10.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}事到如今 就再抛一次硬币
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.87,0:19:12.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给你把生命值加上去！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.65,0:19:15.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行！下次可不一定还会是正面啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.32,0:19:18.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拿出气势来！一飞冲天！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.07,0:19:23.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？陷阱卡？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.63,0:19:25.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（轨道７）是的 快斗大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.42,0:19:26.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特隆那奇怪的行动{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.40,0:19:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是有人用陷阱卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.00,0:19:30.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在他的行进路线上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.02,0:19:31.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是因为有人在妨碍他。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.01,0:19:35.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被设下的卡上全都带着蝴蝶之名。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.54,0:19:38.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蝴蝶的卡……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.78,0:19:46.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德罗瓦。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.64,0:19:49.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆是我的猎物！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.30,0:19:50.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁都不许出手。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.56,0:19:52.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么你要对托隆！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.52,0:19:56.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是向心园先生宣誓效忠之人。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.15,0:20:00.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与他为敌的家伙无论是谁我都会击溃。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.28,0:20:04.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了来了来了！这次是德罗瓦。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.22,0:20:07.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}她也是原WBC运营委员。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.44,0:20:09.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗实力也是超一流！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.90,0:20:13.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与复活的戈什一同突进！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.74,0:20:20.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《德罗瓦确实向我宣誓了忠诚。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.47,0:20:23.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 为什么要妨碍快斗……》
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.74,0:20:25.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别妨碍我！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.61,0:20:27.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会让你过去的！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.86,0:20:29.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和托隆战斗的是我！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.85,0:20:32.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然如此，你也别怪我不留情！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.10,0:20:34.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这句话，原样奉还！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.37,0:20:37.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我支付1000生命值
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.44,0:20:39.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动永续魔法，胡蝶之舞。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.64,0:20:41.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}手牌中每有一张
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.83,0:20:43.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}名字带有蝶的怪兽卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.61,0:20:46.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就给对方造成300点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.33,0:20:52.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…不小心把路线…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.46,0:20:59.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}活下去…快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.01,0:21:03.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《抽卡：前方是丛林场地》
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.79,0:21:08.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要把我的卡组最擅长的热带密林引诱过来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.23,0:21:10.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也就有胜机了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.74,0:21:12.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是那个人啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.85,0:21:15.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给我设下陷阱并引导我过去的。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.98,0:21:19.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好吧，我就顺着你的邀请来。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.63,0:21:23.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然你这么想和我战斗…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.64,0:21:48.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦…简直就像真正的丛林一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.98,0:21:51.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里就是你期望的地方？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.00,0:21:54.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。丛林场地……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.57,0:21:57.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们两人战斗的舞台。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.36,0:22:00.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好像挺有意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.50,0:24:12.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗过山车 真好玩啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.90,0:24:16.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在的我们可没闲工夫享受决斗过山车。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.08,0:24:18.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 明里姐的摩托我是真比不过啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.95,0:24:21.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}摩托！？游马你没有和明里出去的安排吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.29,0:24:23.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你对摩托有兴趣啊！

